{"id":"n72407-1-8","stage":0,"title":"하숙집 · 寄宿处","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72407-1-8-1","ko":"승규야, 너희 집은 어디야?","zh":"承奎，你家在哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"집은","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집은","audio":"/audio/4f9292df3492ba091440.mp3"}},{"text":"어디야?","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디야","audio":"/audio/3d238c840b300c329bff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac8e119669859964cc12.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72407-1-8-2","ko":"난 학교 앞에 있는 하숙집에 살아.","zh":"我住在学校门口的寄宿屋。","note":"